WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The news is changing so rapidly every day

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.413
it's hard to keep up.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.840
At the moment,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.510
as COVID cases taper off

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.850
in countries like France and
Italy, they're going down,

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.750
the number of cases in the United States

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.550
continues to spike, sadly.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.480
And that's why the European
Union recently announced

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.360
Americans are not allowed to travel there

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.590
until further notice.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.803
We can't go to Europe. We're banned.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.580
It's a very extreme measure.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.850
I understand it, but it's extreme.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.850
And this new tourism ad
for the European Union...

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.780
I don't know. I didn't
really appreciate it.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.613
Take a look.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.430
[Narrator] The European Union
is open for tourism again.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.949
Come see it all, from the snow-capped Alps

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:50.147
to the verdant hills of Umbria.

00:00:50.147 --> 00:00:53.040
There's so much to see in the E.U.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.330
But even better, here's something
you won't see right now:

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.810
Americans!

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.030
Because of massive COVID
outbreaks in the U.S.,

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.940
Americans are banned from traveling here,

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.770
which means you'll get
to experience Europe

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:07.600
without experiencing American tourists

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.830
complaining about our very
reasonable portion sizes.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.340
No Americans making fun

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.770
of David's perfectly averaged-sized penis.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:19.350
You won't see American idiots doing this.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.600
Or this.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.900
No Americans demanding their
steak tartare cooked well done.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.240
Or pointing and laughing
at our immodest swimwear.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.080
So relax and enjoy America-free Europe!

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:36.340
Filled with busy cafes
and empty McDonald's.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:37.860
Visit the E.U. now.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.773
Quick! Before they find a vaccine.

